      {
        "company": "TheHiveCareers",
        "description": "<h3>Location: Caribbean (Remote) </h3><h3>Job Type: Executive | Remote </h3><h3>About the Role: </h3><p>We are seeking a Chief Engineer to direct engineering operations for infrastructure, systems, or product-based projects across the Caribbean. </p><h3>Responsibilities: </h3><p>Oversee technical design, implementation, and performance standards </p><p>Manage multidisciplinary teams and contractors </p><p>Ensure quality assurance, regulatory compliance, and safety </p><p>Lead engineering planning, budgeting, and innovation </p><h3>Requirements: </h3><p>Bachelors or Masters in Engineering (Civil, Electrical, Mechanical, etc.) </p><h3>10+ years in engineering leadership </h3><h3>Caribbean/regional experience preferred </h3><h3>Licensure or PE designation is a plus </h3><p>Originally posted on <a href="https://himalayas.app">Himalayas</a></p>",
        "id": "himalayas:https://himalayas.app/companies/thehivecareers/jobs/remote-chief-engineer",
