      {
        "company": "SAPSOL Technologies Inc.",
        "description": "<h3>Must have:</h3><ul>
<li><strong>Hydraulic Systems</strong></li>
<li><strong>Fuel Systems</strong></li>
<li><strong>Hydromechanical Systems</strong></li>
<li><strong>System Integration</strong></li>
<li><strong>Mechanical Design</strong></li>
</ul><p><strong>Job Responsibilities:</strong><br> •Support design and development of hydromechanical systems<br> •Perform analysis of hydraulic and fuel systems</p><h3> •Support system integration activities</h3><p> •Participate in design reviews and validation activities<br> •Support testing and validation of hydromechanical systems<br> •Perform troubleshooting and root cause analysis</p><p><strong>Qualifications:</strong><br> •Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Engineering<br> •Experience in hydromechanical systems or related domain<br> •Knowledge of hydraulic and fuel systems<br> •Knowledge of system engineering principles<br> •Experience in mechanical system design and integration</p><p>Originally posted on <a href="https://himalayas.app">Himalayas</a></p>",
        "id": "himalayas:https://himalayas.app/companies/sapsol-technologies-inc/jobs/hydromechanical-engineer",
